lign: center;\">Color</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Black</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 --></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul class=\"pct_productFeatureList\">\n<li>\n<p>Small-sized trapezoidal teeth with high contact area and good meshing performance</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Suitable for light loads and precision drive systems</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Pitch 2.032 mm (0.08 inch)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Smooth, quiet performance, along with rugged durability and enhanced longevitys</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 -->\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
